 #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Typing (( anywhere prose is allowed in an Obsidian note opens a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]fast, calm, keyboard-first picker over every task in the vault. [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Choosing a task replaces the token with the same [\\[note#^id]] block[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]link Bob Mac Capture would insert, naming an ID-less task first. [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Under an open Pomodoro the link obeys Task Link rules. Nothing else[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]ever changes by surprise.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]obsidian_task_wikilinks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/obsidian_task_wikilinks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-eq[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-eq/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared task wikilink rules and parity vectors[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]model[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]model: pin bob's wikilink_task pool, order, link-target, and guard rules[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]as shared vectors asserted in bob-cli, and mirror them in a pure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]block-id-prompt model.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Note grammar for the (( trigger[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]trigger[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]trigger: pure (( token detection for Markdown notes, its note-only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exclusions, and the written-second-paren auto-open rule, pinned by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Warm vault task index[/bold #D7AFFF]                                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]index[dim] · [dim][/dim]after model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]index: an incrementally maintained, mtime-validated vault task index [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with live-editor overlays, streaming cold builds, and performance [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]budgets.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task Wikilink Picker card and identified-link insert[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]picker[dim] · [dim][/dim]after trigger, index[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker: wire the trigger to the new card, render it beautifully, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]insert links for identified rows, with Escape, Backspace, the reopen [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]command, and reference docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Name-then-link for ID-less tasks[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]naming[dim] · [dim][/dim]after picker[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]naming: the Block ID prompt's wikilink mode, its back-to-picker [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lifecycle, closed-task support, and stale-line relocation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task Link rules under an open Pomodoro[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pomodoro[dim] · [dim][/dim]after naming[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pomodoro: Pomodoro mode (no history, lane/schedule/type consequences, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]blocked handling, duplicate guard, budget notice) plus the ^^ alignment.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Real-Obsidian verification, visual polish, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]review[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pomodoro[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]review: Chromium previews and a real-Obsidian e2e on athena, polish [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]driven by the screenshots, the final docs pass, and deployment.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-eq","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-eq.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0013a2b90cda97f1f17760110e09801a","started_at":"2026-10-30T16:11:43.384970","state":"dismissed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":"2026-10-30T19:56:17.666535","files":{"chat":{"digest":"7464050bf9fe644dad8a716311999c5caec28acf7613946145e916d92f27a69d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-eq.6--1/chat.md","size_bytes":9578},"commits":{"digest":"128449ca6b9a423b9f3c4b76f6d3f0133fd5f56f54480f8e4a13a7001a565591","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-eq.6--1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"72a34185632f398eb9eafe06ccdb1410145d2a36c023191c03616a678e2a0cee","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-eq.6--1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":67},"meta":{"digest":"2b71387ffa66dfb8a98a9024d00e756e06e687b506bf97d48141933fdf437fb4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-eq.6--1/meta.json","size_bytes":676},"prompt":{"digest":"b8b711fd24806578ce924b1da59db2eec90cc0b0f1f73802a80c5eb343c7279d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-eq.6--1/prompt.md","size_bytes":2423},"state":{"digest":"e66013a78651ec102ac6a21924fc5771beef9ef3040673cb865711447419154b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-eq.6--1/state.json","size_bytes":225}},"finished_at":"2026-10-30T19:56:1